/T (         Cancer cases are rising worldwide, so more patients are exposed to treatments that harm healthy tissue. Healthy tissues are exposed to toxic drugs, causing severe side effects such as hair loss, nausea, weakened immunity and organ damage. Because of this toxicity, doctors often cannot give the full effective dose. Tumors differ from patient to patient, so one target marker is not always reliable.)
/E (         Cancer cases are rising worldwide, so more patients are exposed to treatments that harm healthy tissue. Healthy tissues are exposed to toxic drugs, causing severe side effects such as hair loss, nausea, weakened immunity and organ damage. Because of this toxicity, doctors often cannot give the full effective dose. Tumors differ from patient to patient, so one target marker is not always reliable.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
